Today we congratulate Master of Public Policy student Erinn Bell on her successful Analytical Paper proposal defense! Erinn is studying marine mammal strandings along the U.S. East Coast in relation to policies that may directly or indirectly affect the number/distribution of such incidents. Erinn has also been winning a string of fellowships and travel awards to fund an upcoming trip to present this work in Glasgow Scotland! 

